       character-cell coordinates is enclosed by  a  given  window,  returning
       TTRRUUEE  if  it is and FFAALLSSEE otherwise.  It is useful for determining what
       subset of the screen windows enclose the location of a mouse event.

       If the parameter is a pad, wweenncclloossee uses the most recent screen coordi‐
       nates used for this pad in pprreeffrreesshh(3X) or ppnnoouuttrreeffrreesshh(3X).

